    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a survivor of a passenger plane crash, stranded in the heart of Siberia's icy wasteland. This frozen landscape is unforgiving \u2013 extreme temperatures, unpredictable weather, wild animals, and relentless hunger are just a few of the challenges you\u2019ll face. You're on your own, and every second could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/e8bcc8208046925bba0d2205357f92d6.poster.avif?t=1745499463\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/e8bcc8208046925bba0d2205357f92d6.webm?t=1745499463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the wreckage and whatever you can scavenge from the surroundings, you must craft shelter, weapons, and essential tools to survive. Make use of every piece of the plane and the remnants of passengers' luggage to increase your chances. Search for food, learn to make fire, and stand against the merciless forces of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/ff1841fe126b226ea7559d18bd2725ce.poster.avif?t=1745499463\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/ff1841fe126b226ea7559d18bd2725ce.webm?t=1745499463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you attempt to find civilization, or will you build your own camp and wait for rescue? Remember \u2013 help may never come, and the only person you can rely on is yourself. How long will you survive in this deadly wilderness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/b69b77fa7579286d9f20e3c36794ddde.poster.avif?t=1745499463\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/b69b77fa7579286d9f20e3c36794ddde.webm?t=1745499463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a survivor of a passenger plane crash, stranded in the heart of Siberia's icy wasteland. This frozen landscape is unforgiving \u2013 extreme temperatures, unpredictable weather, wild animals, and relentless hunger are just a few of the challenges you\u2019ll face. You're on your own, and every second could mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/e8bcc8208046925bba0d2205357f92d6.poster.avif?t=1745499463\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/e8bcc8208046925bba0d2205357f92d6.webm?t=1745499463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the wreckage and whatever you can scavenge from the surroundings, you must craft shelter, weapons, and essential tools to survive. Make use of every piece of the plane and the remnants of passengers' luggage to increase your chances. Search for food, learn to make fire, and stand against the merciless forces of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/ff1841fe126b226ea7559d18bd2725ce.poster.avif?t=1745499463\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/ff1841fe126b226ea7559d18bd2725ce.webm?t=1745499463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you attempt to find civilization, or will you build your own camp and wait for rescue? Remember \u2013 help may never come, and the only person you can rely on is yourself. How long will you survive in this deadly wilderness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/b69b77fa7579286d9f20e3c36794ddde.poster.avif?t=1745499463\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556370/extras/b69b77fa7579286d9f20e3c36794ddde.webm?t=1745499463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The crash is just the beginning. Trapped in the frozen hell of Siberia, you must fight for every single day. Use the wreckage, build shelter, find food, and face deadly threats. Rescue may never come \u2013 how long can you survive?",
